{"id":"n80410-1-8","stage":5,"title":"터놓다 · 打开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n80410-1-8-1","ko":"이 마을은 이웃끼리 담을 터놓고 지내신다고요?","zh":"听说这个村子邻里之间把围墙打开，互相通着？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"마을은","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마을은","audio":"/audio/6918fc2452047ca5849c.mp3"}},{"text":"이웃끼리","meaning":"邻居，邻里","explanation":"이웃：邻居，邻里；끼리：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31487","senseId":"2","lemma":"이웃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이웃끼리","audio":"/audio/138e2c54e76bd0f72180.mp3"}},{"text":"담을","meaning":"围墙","explanation":"담：围墙；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"담","audio":"/audio/3f34a6ccae9989721bd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28390","senseId":"1","lemma":"담","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담을","audio":"/audio/ff8a428b081c954b56dd.mp3"}},{"text":"터놓고","meaning":"打开，敞开","explanation":"터놓다：打开，敞开；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"터놓다","audio":"/audio/5bad9f217398d9585a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"80410","senseId":"1","lemma":"터놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"터놓고","audio":"/audio/f9ec1d84998260ab3d6c.mp3"}},{"text":"지내신다고요?","meaning":"相处，交往","explanation":"지내다：相处，交往；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"2","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내신다고요","audio":"/audio/55a744ad55a94b292c05.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"16a6e53889b32d5b","term":"마을","zh":"村子，村庄","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3","entryId":"61099","definition":"多户人家聚集生活的地方。","pronunciation":["마을"]},{"id":"56a0fd1527d12237","term":"이웃","zh":"邻居，邻里","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3","entryId":"31487","definition":"与自己的家邻近的家；或居住在那个房子里的人。","pronunciation":["이욷"]},{"id":"3f34a6ccae998972","term":"담","zh":"围墙","audio":"/audio/3f34a6ccae9989721bd8.mp3","entryId":"28390","definition":"为了挡住房子或一定空间而在其周围堆砌的东西。","pronunciation":["담"]},{"id":"5bad9f217398d958","term":"터놓다","zh":"打开，敞开","audio":"/audio/5bad9f217398d9585a47.mp3","entryId":"80410","definition":"打通堵塞的道路或开放关闭的门。","pronunciation":["터노타"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"相处，交往","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"与他人维持一定的关系过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e47f1a21f8e1b6b55e9d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n80410-1-8-2","ko":"네, 그만큼 서로 가깝게 지낸다는 뜻이에요.","zh":"是的，这说明大家相处得很亲近。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，是的，哎","explanation":"네：是，是的，哎。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"1","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"그만큼","meaning":"那些，那样，那么多","explanation":"그만큼：那些，那样，那么多。","readings":[{"term":"그만큼","audio":"/audio/36d7b92275247d826568.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88813","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만큼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만큼","audio":"/audio/36d7b92275247d826568.mp3"}},{"text":"서로","meaning":"互